            "notes": "## For your first rounds you wanna focus on healing fast and efficiently to gain good amount of money that's the reason we focus on  [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) ,  [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) to transition later on an  [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) base build\n _________________________________________\n# Power :\n\n [Two-Zu](item_80f16d3e-a4c0-4fa8-90b1-a0f033a1a77b) \n* perfect for clutch heals\n _________________________________________\n\n## Items :\n\n\ud83d\udc8a  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) \n* (\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f 25 Armor ) Armor will give you damage reduction as well\n\n\ud83d\udc8a  [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) \n* (\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f 25 Armor ) Dmg Reduction + regen faster\n___\n\n  Why using Only Survival Object ?\n\n  Simple : most of the time you will never notice a 5% buff to your stats so you are passing away to a lot of survival potential more survival means no more money feeding",
