            "notes": "## Keep healing and try to use your knife often it's part of kiri's kit to gain more money\n _________________________________________\n ## \ud83d\udff0 Items :\nThe combo of  [Teamwork Toolkit](item_d56fb90c-cbe6-4ad5-8475-0ce920f92a3f)  and  [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) are the most optimized this early in the game\n\n\u2694\ufe0f [Teamwork Toolkit](item_d56fb90c-cbe6-4ad5-8475-0ce920f92a3f) \n* (\ud83d\udca510 % ) will give your teammates 10 %  [Move Speed](stat_move_speed) \n\n\u2694\ufe0f [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) \n* ( \ud83d\udca5 5% ) will give you 10 %  [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) after healing an ally\n\n\ud83d\udc8a [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) \n* (\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f 25 Armor )\n\n\ud83d\udc8a [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) \n* (\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f 25 Armor ) not a must have if you don't have enough money\n\n _________________________________________\n### Optional : \n\n\u2694\ufe0f [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) \n* (\ud83d\udca55% )",
