            "notes": "At this point you should start to tp and use your ability more if done correctly your mercy should be able to dps boost your ally more often because you'll be able to do 6k heals minimum per round\n _________________________________________\n# Power :\n\nBoth of those powers work well in this build you don't have a precise order to pick them\n\n[Clone Conjuration](item_6c9f6be1-ab29-4f46-af24-34e4835f9af3) \n* got patched ! his stats will now display and count as your stats perfect to help you farm money / heal your allies \n\n [Cleansing Charge](item_4721f307-30d2-4fc1-a10b-6de7141deb68) \n* will give you ultimate charge everytime you cleanse an ally , for more info on this item go R5\n\n\n _________________________________________\n## \ud83d\udff0 Items :\n\n\ud83e\udd8a  [Donut Delivery](item_296adb69-d517-4885-903a-ef8f3a1d6a7b) \n* (\u23f1\ufe0f 10 % )  One of the most broken item for kiri in this current state of the game\n\n \u2694\ufe0f  [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) \n* (\u26a1 10 % ,\u23f1\ufe0f 5% )\n\n\ud83d\udc8a [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) \n* (\u23f1\ufe0f 5%  + 25 OverHealth ) is the most broken Survival item for heroes with high [Cooldown Reduction](stat_cooldown_reduction)  / ability based\n\n \ud83e\udd8a [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) \n* ( \u26a1 10 % ) will boost your suzu\n _________________________________________\n### Optional : \n\n\ud83e\udd8a [Talisman of Life](item_7ecfd3eb-d869-41fe-87eb-0bb2e82e5718) \n* (\u26a120 % )\n\n---\nif you have more money refer to [Know your Play Style](##heading-ids)",
